          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FROM registro.e01_sesiones\nWHERE tipo = 'INTRUSO' AND abierta < now() - interval '3 seconds'\n  AND (aviso IS NULL OR demora_ms > 2000 OR NOT completo) AND $__timeFilter(abierta)",
